2Then`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.foldlInPlace2Then","kind":"def","line":716,"name":"ScalarArray.Float32Array.foldlInPlace2Then","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.lean#L716-L729"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size_foldlInPlace2\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">size_foldlInPlace2</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> v}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">xs </span><span class=\"fn\">ys </span><span class=\"fn\">rs </span><span class=\"fn\">len</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hx</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">xs</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">len</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hy</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">ys</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.