n class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.foldlInPlace2\">foldlInPlace2</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">xs</span> <span class=\"fn\">ys</span> <span class=\"fn\">rs</span> <span class=\"fn\">len</span> <span class=\"fn\">hx</span> <span class=\"fn\">hy</span> <span class=\"fn\">hr</span> <span class=\"fn\">init</span> <span class=\"fn\">f</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size_foldlInPlace2","kind":"theorem","line":700,"name":"ScalarArray.Float32Array.size_foldlInPlace2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.lean#L700-L705"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.foldlInPlace2\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldlInPlace2</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> v}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">xs </span><span class=\"fn\">ys </span><span class=\"fn\">rs </span><span class=\"fn\">len</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hx</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">xs</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">len</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hy</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">ys</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">len</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hr</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">rs</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">len</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">init</span> : <span class=\"fn\">β</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">len</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">β</span> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Writes the window of `len` elements at `rs` from the windows at `xs` and `ys` of the same array,\nin place, threading an accumulator: for each `j < len`, from `0` up, it reads `x := a[xs + j]` and\n`y := a[ys + j]` from the current array, then stores the first component of `f j hj x y b` at\n`rs + j`, and the second component is the next accumulator. Returns the new array and the last\naccumulator.\n\nEach step reads after the writes of the earlier steps, so overlapping windows are well defined: with\n`rs = xs + 1`, for example, step `j` reads what step `j - 1` wrote. Reading the windows through `f`\nrather than through another reference to `a` keeps `a` exclusive, which a second reference would\nnot, and then the first write would copy the whole array.\n\nThe array is made exclusive once, before the loop, which then reads and stores without checks.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.foldlInPlace2","kind":"def","line":670,"name":"ScalarArray.Float32Array.foldlInPlace2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.lean#L670-L690"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.foldlInPlace2.loop\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldlInPlace2</span>.<span class=\"name\">loop</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> v}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">xs </span><span class=\"fn\">ys </span><span class=\"fn\">rs </span><span class=\"fn\">len</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">len</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">β</span> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hx</span> : <span class=\"fn\">xs</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">len</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hy</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ys</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">len</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hr</span> : <span class=\"fn\">rs</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">len</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <span class=\"fn\">β</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The loop of `foldlInPlace2`, over `Nat` offsets and indices.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.foldlInPlace2.loop","kind":"def","line":635,"name":"ScalarArray.Float32Array.foldlInPlace2.loop","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/Float32/InPlace.lean#L635-L650"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theor